TEXT -448 -176 Left 2 ;Experiment 6(b): 2:1 Multiplexer using logic gates
TEXT -448 -128 Left 1 ;Y = (S' . D0) + (S . D1)      S=0 -> Y=D0,  S=1 -> Y=D1
TEXT -448 736 Left 2 !.tran 0 40m 0 10u
